{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18813","headline":"詶乐天闻新蝉见赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶乐天闻新蝉见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧树鸣蝉後，烟云改容光。\n瑟然引秋气，芳草日夜黄。\n夹道喧古槐，临池思垂杨。\n离人下忆泪，志士激刚肠。\n昔闻阻山川，今听同匡牀。\n人情便所遇，音韵岂殊常。\n因之比笙竽，送我游醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}